WEBVTT

01:30.470 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.360 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 12]

01:39.509 --> 01:41.039
Look at the lines of
the Four-season painting.

01:41.039 --> 01:42.280
You can touch it.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.000
Touch it?

01:43.280 --> 01:43.920
May I?

01:43.920 --> 01:44.789
Yes.

01:46.560 --> 01:47.820
Zhengliang, touch it.

01:48.920 --> 01:51.120
Third Aunt is skillful, right?

01:52.200 --> 01:53.200
Let me see.

01:54.680 --> 01:56.680
Manager Shao seems like a rough man,

01:56.680 --> 01:59.140
but his gold-tracing technique is amazing.

02:02.400 --> 02:04.130
There are exactly four pieces.

02:05.760 --> 02:06.920
The Spring piece

02:07.310 --> 02:09.800
is for my beautiful sister-in-law.

02:10.960 --> 02:12.000
Thank you, Zhen.

02:15.430 --> 02:16.360
The Summer piece

02:16.520 --> 02:18.590
is for my loud-voiced mother.

02:19.980 --> 02:21.100
Thank you, Zhen.

02:22.430 --> 02:24.760
The Autumn piece is for my honest brother.

02:25.120 --> 02:26.050
Thank you, Zhen.

02:26.870 --> 02:28.200
As for the Winter piece,

02:28.710 --> 02:30.190
it conceals its sharpness
to store its energy.

02:30.190 --> 02:32.400
That is for Grandfather.

02:36.750 --> 02:37.680
Grandfather,

02:37.710 --> 02:40.120
the Li family's ink workshop
is incredible,

02:40.120 --> 02:42.430
much tidier than others.

02:42.470 --> 02:43.590
When I was young,

02:43.590 --> 02:45.520
I used to play hide-and-seek inside,

02:45.520 --> 02:46.800
going in and out,

02:46.910 --> 02:48.750
but I never knew what that place was for.

02:48.750 --> 02:49.950
Going back this time,

02:50.079 --> 02:51.800
I finally got the hang of it.

02:52.190 --> 02:53.750
I couldn't even count

02:53.770 --> 02:55.970
the amazing things in the ink workshop.

02:56.079 --> 02:57.360
If I could spend

02:57.360 --> 02:59.280
months with the workers in it,

02:59.470 --> 03:01.910
I'd develop many new inks.

03:08.360 --> 03:09.150
Zhen.

03:10.520 --> 03:12.380
Although you intended to go back,

03:12.750 --> 03:14.080
I'm afraid the Li family

03:14.230 --> 03:15.670
won't accept you.

03:21.240 --> 03:22.120
Zhen.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.240
Tell me,

03:27.680 --> 03:28.560
what are

03:29.280 --> 03:30.280
your plans?

03:35.800 --> 03:36.840
I'll make a plan

03:41.840 --> 03:43.840
after the ink testing event ends.

03:44.470 --> 03:47.079
The lacquer-soot ink isn't truly finished

03:47.079 --> 03:49.079
until the ink testing event is over.

03:50.870 --> 03:51.590
Zhen.

03:52.240 --> 03:53.400
After the event,

03:53.520 --> 03:54.630
the lacquer-soot ink

03:54.630 --> 03:56.520
has nothing to do with you.

03:57.680 --> 03:59.210
It doesn't matter, Mother.

03:59.430 --> 04:01.400
Anyway, I have all these skills.

04:01.590 --> 04:03.000
If I win a prize,

04:03.520 --> 04:06.000
I'll buy us a new house.

04:09.710 --> 04:10.510
Grandfather,

04:11.190 --> 04:12.520
will you go to the event?

04:21.160 --> 04:23.560
The colleagues of the Huizhou ink industry

04:24.070 --> 04:25.730
will definitely all be there.

04:26.310 --> 04:27.920
Since I have long sworn

04:28.680 --> 04:30.080
to quit the ink industry,

04:32.150 --> 04:34.350
it wouldn't be appropriate for me to go.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.000
However,

04:42.720 --> 04:43.800
I wish

04:44.600 --> 04:46.200
that your lacquer-soot ink,

04:47.830 --> 04:49.760
the Li family's lacquer-soot ink,

04:52.600 --> 04:53.930
will be a great success.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.270
Okay.

04:59.920 --> 05:03.070
I, a maker of lacquer-soot ink, Li Zhen,

05:04.070 --> 05:05.000
announce that

05:05.360 --> 05:07.000
my first ink testing event

05:07.930 --> 05:08.870
starts now.

06:12.270 --> 06:14.040
What do you think?

06:18.040 --> 06:19.720
Let me take a look.

06:21.750 --> 06:24.190
The ink on the lines is like lacquer.

06:24.720 --> 06:27.630
It gives off a lively shine
where the stroke ends.

06:27.920 --> 06:31.480
As for the layers, it's lyrical
and dynamic.

06:33.190 --> 06:35.680
Good ink.

06:35.800 --> 06:39.360
It's a top-notch ink.

06:44.159 --> 06:44.800
Grandfather.

06:44.800 --> 06:46.070
Did I look like you?

06:48.470 --> 06:49.210
[Li's Residence]

07:00.940 --> 07:04.930
[Cuiqiao Cottage]

07:10.400 --> 07:14.660
[The Mortuary Tablet of
Late Husband Yu Gonghai]

07:19.680 --> 07:20.310
Sister.

07:39.630 --> 07:42.560
I didn't expect Miss Li Zhen

07:42.560 --> 07:45.360
could restore
the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

07:46.390 --> 07:49.360
Li Zhen has a talent for ink making.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.190
But I didn't expect

07:51.360 --> 07:53.690
that the one who got involved
would be her.

07:54.159 --> 07:55.830
Things have settled down.

07:56.070 --> 07:57.240
Since you've tested the waters,

07:57.240 --> 07:59.240
the way forward is clear now, right?

08:00.040 --> 08:02.640
It's my good fortune
that God grants my wishes.

08:03.750 --> 08:06.000
It seems you have made up your mind

08:06.000 --> 08:07.120
to invest in Li Ink.

08:07.720 --> 08:08.750
I wonder

08:09.160 --> 08:10.420
whether your decision

08:11.270 --> 08:13.000
involves any selfish motives.

08:14.190 --> 08:15.000
Sister.

08:15.870 --> 08:18.480
The hardest thing in the world
is to have it both ways.

08:18.480 --> 08:20.310
Since there is an opportunity now,

08:20.310 --> 08:21.630
why don't I seize it?

08:21.950 --> 08:23.040
Right, Sister?

08:36.360 --> 08:38.000
I was a merchant on the sea.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.600
You are a fugitive on the run.

08:41.360 --> 08:43.870
We are both outcasts.

08:45.320 --> 08:47.600
If Marshal Qi
and General didn't take us in,

08:47.600 --> 08:49.600
we would have died long ago.

08:53.480 --> 08:55.320
Marshal Qi and General have done us

08:55.320 --> 08:56.450
a tremendous favor.

08:58.000 --> 08:59.120
But Sister,

08:59.720 --> 09:01.450
what exactly do you want to say?

09:02.720 --> 09:05.390
I know about your blood feud
with the Tian family.

09:05.390 --> 09:06.600
But preparing military supplies

09:06.600 --> 09:08.960
is the top priority
of our trip to Huizhou.

09:09.270 --> 09:11.400
We have been sworn siblings for years,

09:11.750 --> 09:13.750
no different from biological ones.

09:13.870 --> 09:15.000
As your sister,

09:15.000 --> 09:17.360
I can't watch you act on impulse,

09:17.480 --> 09:18.440
mess up the task,

09:18.440 --> 09:20.300
and bring trouble upon yourself.

09:24.030 --> 09:25.200
You're right.

09:26.120 --> 09:27.650
Thank you for the reminder.

09:28.000 --> 09:30.150
I will definitely go all out

09:30.200 --> 09:32.660
and handle the military supplies properly.

09:32.750 --> 09:33.670
But

09:34.670 --> 09:35.870
how can I stop

09:36.480 --> 09:38.080
avenging them for my family?

09:39.120 --> 09:40.390
I just hope

09:40.870 --> 09:42.440
you don't act impulsively.

09:45.480 --> 09:49.900
[Qingfeng Pavilion]

09:52.750 --> 09:54.600
I know what to do.

09:55.790 --> 09:56.720
Sister.

09:57.670 --> 09:58.600
Don't worry.

10:03.080 --> 10:03.960
Girl.

10:04.790 --> 10:06.550
The invitations for people in Jinling

10:06.550 --> 10:08.240
have already been sent out.

10:09.080 --> 10:12.140
As for the major ink merchants
and managers in Huizhou,

10:12.390 --> 10:13.320
I will let

10:13.480 --> 10:15.080
someone deliver them later.

10:17.320 --> 10:20.550
I will go personally to the ink workshops

10:21.790 --> 10:23.000
that have good relations with Li Ink,

10:23.000 --> 10:24.400
and to Third Master Chen.

10:24.750 --> 10:26.270
But as for Lord Yan,

10:28.600 --> 10:31.910
you should go invite him yourself

10:32.910 --> 10:35.200
as you are the maker of
the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

10:35.200 --> 10:36.120
Good idea.

10:36.240 --> 10:38.100
Sixth Grandfather, I will go now.

10:38.150 --> 10:38.680
Go ahead.

10:42.650 --> 10:45.030
[Deshan Hall]

10:49.390 --> 10:51.590
Are you going to the ink workshop again?

10:51.770 --> 10:53.000
I changed the ink recipe today.

10:53.000 --> 10:54.150
I seem to have some clues.

10:54.150 --> 10:55.150
Then, go quickly!

10:55.480 --> 10:57.120
The deadline is approaching.

10:57.120 --> 10:58.840
We can't let the whole Huizhou

10:59.340 --> 11:00.670
laugh at Tian Ink.

11:01.360 --> 11:03.560
I'm afraid we are bound to become a joke.

11:03.910 --> 11:05.030
Li Zhen

11:05.200 --> 11:08.060
managed to recreate
the ancient lacquer-soot ink!

11:08.600 --> 11:09.390
I heard that

11:09.670 --> 11:11.720
the Li family is going
to hold an ink testing event.

11:11.720 --> 11:14.030
They invited all major merchants
and famous scholars in Huizhou

11:14.030 --> 11:16.440
to test the ink in their shop.

11:17.270 --> 11:19.630
Father, what should we do?

11:21.240 --> 11:22.150
Why panic?

11:23.630 --> 11:26.000
The Li family wants
to hold an ink testing event?

11:26.000 --> 11:26.790
Okay.

11:27.720 --> 11:28.960
I'd like to see

11:29.630 --> 11:32.490
how they're going to pull off
the ink testing event.

11:32.600 --> 11:35.220
[Yan's Mansion]

11:43.130 --> 11:44.500
[To Lord Yan]

11:52.480 --> 11:53.960
I remember that

11:54.150 --> 11:56.440
your family also announced

11:56.440 --> 11:58.390
to restore the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.030
Yes.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.670
But now,

12:01.150 --> 12:04.240
the Li family has already made it.

12:04.480 --> 12:06.840
Why is your family holding

12:06.870 --> 12:08.630
another ink testing event?

12:09.030 --> 12:09.720
What are you

12:10.000 --> 12:11.240
going to do?

12:13.030 --> 12:13.910
Lord Yan.

12:14.680 --> 12:17.520
I didn't want to be so ostentatious.

12:18.440 --> 12:20.910
But my father asked someone
to send this Baibao Ink

12:20.910 --> 12:22.080
to the capital

12:22.200 --> 12:23.750
and present it to Lord Xu.

12:23.960 --> 12:26.270
Lord Xu praised it after using it.

12:26.630 --> 12:29.150
I want to hold an event

12:29.150 --> 12:30.910
to honor Lord Xu's favor.

12:32.870 --> 12:35.960
Lord Yan, I hope you will grace
us with your presence

12:36.960 --> 12:38.420
and join this grand event.

12:44.200 --> 12:44.910
You...

12:45.200 --> 12:45.840
Master,

12:45.910 --> 12:47.080
Miss Li Zhen is here to deliver

12:47.080 --> 12:49.550
the invitation for
the lacquer-soot ink testing event.

12:49.550 --> 12:50.390
Invite her in.

12:50.630 --> 12:51.360
Okay.

12:55.510 --> 12:57.030
What a coincidence.

12:57.550 --> 13:00.550
You just delivered an innovation,

13:01.240 --> 13:03.200
and Miss Li Zhen followed it instantly.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.790
What a coincidence!

13:06.000 --> 13:07.130
What a coincidence.

13:07.750 --> 13:08.950
Coincidence indeed.

13:14.910 --> 13:15.630
Zhen.

13:19.000 --> 13:21.000
I didn't expect such a coincidence.

13:21.030 --> 13:22.440
Our two families' ink testing events

13:22.440 --> 13:23.840
are on the exact same day.

13:25.270 --> 13:26.390
Our ink

13:26.960 --> 13:29.960
has already been recognized
by Lord Xu in the capital.

13:29.960 --> 13:31.240
I'm afraid Lord Yan

13:31.480 --> 13:33.410
won't be able to attend your event.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.200
I really didn't expect

13:36.200 --> 13:37.790
you to have such a trick.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.180
Don't blame me.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.360
I'm not targeting you.

13:41.390 --> 13:43.120
There are no friends in business,

13:43.120 --> 13:44.520
only winners and losers.

13:45.120 --> 13:48.320
But it's still too early to say
who'll come out on top.

13:48.790 --> 13:49.600
Goodbye.

13:53.480 --> 13:54.720
The Tian family

13:55.390 --> 13:58.000
chose to hold their ink testing event

13:58.550 --> 14:00.200
on the same day as ours.

14:01.630 --> 14:04.240
Their intention is self-evident.

14:05.440 --> 14:07.240
Shameless.

14:07.790 --> 14:08.870
Despicable.

14:12.270 --> 14:13.120
Rujun.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.300
Shall we change the date of

14:16.030 --> 14:17.360
our ink testing event?

14:20.480 --> 14:21.240
Zhen.

14:21.600 --> 14:22.960
What do you think?

14:23.390 --> 14:24.600
Seventh Grandmother.

14:24.600 --> 14:26.630
If we blindly make a change
because of external affairs,

14:26.630 --> 14:28.360
we will lose our own direction.

14:28.630 --> 14:31.790
I don't think we can change the date.

14:33.510 --> 14:34.480
Well...

14:35.150 --> 14:37.270
Doing so carries significant risks.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.440
Now,

14:40.390 --> 14:43.200
compared to the Tian Ink,

14:44.440 --> 14:46.320
the odds of our winning are not great.

14:46.320 --> 14:48.840
Then, we must find a way
to increase our odds.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.600
You have an idea?

14:53.390 --> 14:54.510
Seventh Grandmother,

14:54.510 --> 14:55.630
if we could have

14:55.630 --> 14:57.750
an influential master
of calligraphy and painting

14:57.750 --> 14:58.910
to test Li Ink,

14:59.560 --> 15:00.540
and an influential

15:00.540 --> 15:02.480
ink merchant present

15:02.510 --> 15:04.440
to help sell the lacquer-soot ink,

15:04.480 --> 15:06.670
our ink testing event will be a success,
right?

15:06.670 --> 15:07.670
Yes.

15:08.650 --> 15:11.260
Thank about

15:11.280 --> 15:13.150
the candidates for the ink tester.

15:13.150 --> 15:14.750
Do you have any suggestions?

15:16.390 --> 15:17.200
Mother,

15:17.630 --> 15:19.630
there are a few calligraphy masters

15:19.670 --> 15:21.390
on good terms with the Li family.

15:21.390 --> 15:23.450
Mr. Guangyuan is good at seal script.

15:23.720 --> 15:26.440
Mr. Yuanyou is a Court Style.

15:26.510 --> 15:27.150
Mother,

15:27.840 --> 15:29.030
who do you prefer?

15:29.870 --> 15:30.840
Eldest Aunt.

15:32.670 --> 15:34.440
I think neither of these two gentlemen

15:34.440 --> 15:36.910
is suitable for testing
the lacquer-soot ink.

15:36.910 --> 15:37.840
Why?

15:39.290 --> 15:40.320
As for our pine soot ink,

15:40.320 --> 15:42.200
it has a vigorous color.

15:42.390 --> 15:44.650
The seal script matches the Court Style.

15:44.670 --> 15:46.910
But the lacquer-soot ink
excels in variation.

15:46.910 --> 15:47.960
Fluctuating lines

15:47.960 --> 15:50.220
can fully reflect its characteristics.

15:50.630 --> 15:53.150
For testing ink in calligraphy
and painting,

15:53.150 --> 15:54.750
landscape painting is the best.

15:54.750 --> 15:55.630
Seventh Grandmother,

15:55.630 --> 15:58.080
what do you think of Mr. Dongtu?

15:58.390 --> 15:59.240
Who?

16:00.510 --> 16:01.630
Zhan Dongtu?

16:03.630 --> 16:05.480
Are you sleepwalking?

16:06.030 --> 16:06.670
Li Zhen,

16:07.150 --> 16:08.750
do you know Mr. Dongtu?

16:08.750 --> 16:10.870
Do you know his temper?

16:10.870 --> 16:12.550
You're talking nonsense.

16:12.750 --> 16:13.670
Zhan Dongtu...

16:14.790 --> 16:15.600
Rujun.

16:16.750 --> 16:18.550
Mr. Dongtu

16:18.750 --> 16:20.950
only associates with Third Master Chen

16:21.270 --> 16:23.400
and only tests ink for the Chen family.

16:24.320 --> 16:26.380
I'm afraid we will fail to invite him.

16:26.870 --> 16:28.000
Sixth Grandfather,

16:29.480 --> 16:30.720
if we don't try,

16:30.960 --> 16:32.600
how do we know it won't work?

16:34.750 --> 16:35.960
Zhen is right.

16:36.510 --> 16:38.720
Since you already have a plan in mind,

16:39.150 --> 16:40.670
I will leave

16:40.960 --> 16:43.960
this ink testing event entirely to you.

16:57.080 --> 16:57.790
Master.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.480
There's no problem with this account.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.270
Okay.

17:02.240 --> 17:03.200
Master Qi.

17:04.750 --> 17:05.880
What a coincidence.

17:07.290 --> 17:08.130
Miss Li Zhen,

17:08.829 --> 17:10.790
why do you have the leisure to

17:10.920 --> 17:12.180
visit my humble abode?

17:12.829 --> 17:14.589
No one comes knocking without a reason.

17:14.589 --> 17:16.550
I'm here for you.

17:18.160 --> 17:19.270
Now that I'm here,

17:19.270 --> 17:21.329
won't you invite me in for a cup of tea?

17:22.109 --> 17:23.640
Since you need my favour,

17:23.640 --> 17:25.349
I naturally have good tea to treat you.

17:25.349 --> 17:26.210
Please come in.

17:26.720 --> 17:27.480
Thank you.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.550
Mr. He, make tea.

17:29.750 --> 17:30.880
Okay, Master.

17:40.830 --> 17:42.630
Miss Li Zhen, please take a seat.

17:43.070 --> 17:44.070
That is a couch.

17:49.110 --> 17:49.790
Have a seat.

17:57.310 --> 17:58.710
Miss Li Zhen,

17:58.880 --> 18:00.080
what do you want to do?

18:00.720 --> 18:03.050
I came especially to thank you, Master Qi.

18:04.400 --> 18:05.270
For what?

18:05.680 --> 18:06.440
Thank you for

18:06.440 --> 18:08.400
finding the bile for me.

18:09.960 --> 18:10.920
Just for this?

18:11.790 --> 18:12.720
Just for this.

18:13.310 --> 18:14.350
You're welcome.

18:18.200 --> 18:20.000
Master, the tea is here.

18:20.000 --> 18:20.510
Good.

18:22.830 --> 18:23.590
Thank you.

18:27.680 --> 18:28.310
Please.

18:30.830 --> 18:31.760
You drink it too.

18:36.790 --> 18:38.640
Good tea.

18:48.350 --> 18:49.110
Miss Li Zhen,

18:49.550 --> 18:50.750
even without me,

18:50.830 --> 18:52.640
you would definitely

18:52.680 --> 18:54.750
find the answer.

18:55.110 --> 18:55.920
Miss Li Zhen,

18:56.550 --> 18:59.720
what exactly is your business
with me today?

19:02.070 --> 19:05.480
Master Qi, you're so smart.

19:05.640 --> 19:07.350
I came today

19:07.640 --> 19:10.400
for some other matters.

19:10.480 --> 19:11.280
Please say it.

19:13.400 --> 19:16.600
Tian and Li are holding ink testing events
on the same day.

19:16.920 --> 19:19.400
Li Ink needs a major ink merchant

19:19.400 --> 19:20.480
to hold the fort.

19:20.680 --> 19:22.070
So, I want to...

19:23.920 --> 19:24.850
The Tian family?

19:26.640 --> 19:27.680
Did they

19:28.480 --> 19:30.270
restore the ancient lacquer-soot ink?

19:30.270 --> 19:31.510
Of course not.

19:31.830 --> 19:33.880
They just want to embarrass Li Ink

19:33.880 --> 19:35.350
and ruin our ink testing event.

19:35.350 --> 19:37.550
If our ink testing event fails,

19:37.720 --> 19:39.550
not only will Lord Yan lose face,

19:39.680 --> 19:41.960
but your long-standing plans

19:42.000 --> 19:44.510
will also be in vain.

19:48.880 --> 19:50.200
But

19:50.270 --> 19:52.680
it's hard for me

19:53.200 --> 19:54.240
to invite

19:54.240 --> 19:55.550
a major ink merchant.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.510
You flatter me.

19:58.550 --> 20:00.000
The whole Huizhou knows

20:00.000 --> 20:01.400
Master Qi's capability.

20:07.720 --> 20:10.200
If you find it difficult,

20:10.440 --> 20:12.720
just pretend that I never came today.

20:12.920 --> 20:13.590
No rush.

20:14.030 --> 20:14.720
Please.

20:15.790 --> 20:16.550
Thank you.

20:23.480 --> 20:24.680
Then, Master Qi,

20:25.310 --> 20:26.920
I won't disturb you anymore.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.220
I'll take my leave now.

20:29.350 --> 20:30.070
Take care.

20:36.310 --> 20:37.200
Bye.

20:58.510 --> 20:59.350
Miss Li Zhen.

21:06.920 --> 21:08.440
Please rest assured, Miss Li Zhen.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.590
I've known about this issue.

21:09.590 --> 21:11.400
I will do my best to help you.

21:13.110 --> 21:14.310
Thank you, Master Qi.

21:16.480 --> 21:17.550
Girl,

21:18.160 --> 21:19.640
you are truly amazing.

21:22.160 --> 21:23.890
Thank you, Third Grandfather.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.200
Rest assured.

21:26.590 --> 21:27.720
I will definitely attend

21:27.720 --> 21:30.070
your ink testing event to support you.

21:30.830 --> 21:32.560
Thank you, Third Grandfather.

21:33.160 --> 21:35.200
I came today to ask you

21:35.200 --> 21:36.510
to recommend someone

21:36.680 --> 21:39.310
to paint for the event.

21:46.440 --> 21:47.720
I can't.

21:49.240 --> 21:50.440
Third Grandfather,

21:50.550 --> 21:52.350
I haven't even said who it is yet.

21:53.110 --> 21:54.720
Since you came to me,

21:55.000 --> 21:57.030
who else could it be but Mr. Dongtu?

21:57.270 --> 21:58.200
Third Grandfather.

21:58.200 --> 22:00.960
Chen Ink has cooperated with
Mr. Dongtu for years.

22:00.960 --> 22:02.510
You must be very close.

22:02.750 --> 22:04.350
Please help me.

22:06.240 --> 22:07.030
Girl,

22:07.400 --> 22:09.070
I'd like to help you,

22:09.240 --> 22:11.350
but I can't.

22:12.720 --> 22:14.520
For the past year, Mr. Dongtu has

22:14.720 --> 22:17.480
devoted himself to painting
the Xin'an River Landscape painting.

22:17.480 --> 22:19.350
He has tried and failed many times.

22:19.350 --> 22:20.160
So,

22:20.480 --> 22:23.270
he went to Mount Qiyun
to paint in seclusion.

22:30.550 --> 22:31.350
Okay.

22:31.960 --> 22:33.830
Since you won't help me,

22:33.960 --> 22:36.200
then I will go invite him myself.

22:36.750 --> 22:37.920
I came here today

22:38.000 --> 22:39.510
to let you know,

22:39.720 --> 22:41.250
so as not to lose my manners.

22:41.400 --> 22:43.720
Third Grandfather, I'm leaving.

22:44.160 --> 22:44.750
Wait.

22:47.830 --> 22:49.240
Mount Qiyun is so big.

22:49.270 --> 22:50.750
You haven't traveled much.

22:50.750 --> 22:52.080
Where will you find him?

22:52.350 --> 22:53.200
How about this?

22:53.200 --> 22:55.600
Discuss this issue with your family, okay?

22:55.680 --> 22:56.550
No need.

22:56.640 --> 22:57.830
I don't know where to find him either.

22:57.830 --> 23:00.510
I'll just go to Mount Qiyun
and walk around

23:00.510 --> 23:01.440
to look for him.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.440
I'll walk for three or four days,

23:03.440 --> 23:04.400
look around,

23:04.420 --> 23:06.860
and see where Mr. Dongtu is.

23:07.110 --> 23:09.270
Anyway, I'm not
your biological granddaughter,

23:09.270 --> 23:10.920
and you don't care about me at all.

23:10.920 --> 23:12.400
Just let me look for him alone.

23:12.400 --> 23:13.160
Stop!

24:03.680 --> 24:04.880
Take this with you.

24:05.350 --> 24:06.960
Mr. Dongtu will see you.

24:08.920 --> 24:09.960
Thank you, Third Grandfather.

24:09.960 --> 24:11.880
Then, I will take my leave.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.330
I haven't finished yet.

24:14.350 --> 24:15.350
Go ahead.

24:16.680 --> 24:19.160
Mr. Dongtu is a master
of calligraphy and painting.

24:19.160 --> 24:21.160
Don't be abrupt.

24:22.310 --> 24:23.550
Whether this works or not

24:23.550 --> 24:24.240
depends on

24:24.830 --> 24:26.350
you.

24:26.680 --> 24:27.550
I understand.

24:28.070 --> 24:29.160
I know

24:29.160 --> 24:31.000
you adore me the most.

24:31.000 --> 24:31.790
Bye.

24:48.680 --> 24:49.440
Miss Li Zhen.

24:53.640 --> 24:54.590
Why are you here?

24:55.030 --> 24:56.920
Are you going to Mount Qiyun

24:56.920 --> 24:58.270
to look for Mr. Dongtu?

24:59.750 --> 25:01.550
You're quite well-informed.

25:02.960 --> 25:04.830
If you don't mind,

25:04.960 --> 25:07.400
would you like to go with me?

25:09.880 --> 25:10.640
Mount Qiyun

25:10.880 --> 25:13.110
is high and far.

25:13.680 --> 25:16.270
There might be inconveniences
for you to go alone.

25:16.270 --> 25:19.480
If we go together, we can take care of
each other on the road.

25:19.480 --> 25:20.720
What do you think?

25:25.830 --> 25:26.550
Let's go.

25:31.350 --> 25:31.920
Daddy.

25:31.960 --> 25:33.270
Run faster.

25:34.750 --> 25:36.270
Daddy, I'm tired.

25:36.270 --> 25:37.600
I want a piggyback ride.

25:39.440 --> 25:41.310
Daddy, a little faster.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.440
Come on, hold on tight.

25:52.960 --> 25:53.720
What's up?

25:56.070 --> 25:56.720
Nothing.

25:58.030 --> 25:59.360
I just thought of my dad.

25:59.590 --> 26:00.720
When I was young,

26:00.880 --> 26:02.540
my dad would carry me like this

26:03.270 --> 26:05.000
and walk through this archway.

26:07.400 --> 26:09.720
I've heard of your father,

26:10.680 --> 26:14.440
the son of Eighth Master Li, the head
of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters.

26:14.440 --> 26:17.500
The title of the rising star
of Hui Ink is well deserved.

26:19.110 --> 26:20.030
What a pity.

26:20.400 --> 26:22.200
My father passed away too early.

26:25.310 --> 26:26.480
Then,

26:26.550 --> 26:27.810
we are in the same boat.

26:27.830 --> 26:29.630
My father passed away early too.

26:35.750 --> 26:36.920
Tell me,

26:37.480 --> 26:39.000
did your father

26:39.790 --> 26:41.310
like to challenge things

26:41.960 --> 26:44.160
that seemed impossible, just like you?

26:45.030 --> 26:48.030
Was your father

26:48.200 --> 26:49.400
as helpful as you are?

26:57.540 --> 27:01.290
♪ Raindrops fall on
the moss-covered stone steps ♪

26:57.770 --> 27:01.590
[Mount Qiyun]

26:57.880 --> 26:58.510
Let's go.

26:58.720 --> 26:59.520
Go

27:01.720 --> 27:05.760
♪ With a bamboo knife,
you make the spring fade away ♪

27:06.070 --> 27:08.590
♪ Last year's branches are still
hanging in the window ♪

27:08.790 --> 27:15.260
♪ The tea left a stain on the sleeve ♪

27:15.750 --> 27:17.790
I'm exhausted.

27:15.850 --> 27:19.800
♪ The wreathing smoke
gradually dissipated ♪

27:18.350 --> 27:20.030
Let's sit here and take a rest.

27:19.830 --> 27:24.130
♪ Counting the games of our childhood ♪

27:24.580 --> 27:27.190
♪ You lower your eyes
and count the rings of the tree ♪

27:26.160 --> 27:27.220
Let's rest here for a bit.

27:27.220 --> 27:32.850
♪ Scars meander like a stream ♪

27:38.330 --> 27:42.970
♪ The ink-black distant mountains
resemble your eyes and brows ♪

27:43.510 --> 27:47.940
♪ Amid the inky darkness,
it seems as though a galaxy is shifting ♪

27:44.510 --> 27:46.240
When you were in front just now,

27:46.350 --> 27:47.680
did you cut your hand?

27:48.030 --> 27:49.270
It's nothing. Look.

27:48.080 --> 27:52.150
♪ Lend me a bit of
the courage of a piece of pine resin ♪

27:51.960 --> 27:53.510
I wish there were rouge ink.

27:52.170 --> 27:56.440
♪ Amid the frost,
I sketch the unfinished prologue ♪

27:55.200 --> 27:56.030
What ink?

27:56.480 --> 27:57.270
Rouge ink.

27:56.580 --> 28:01.470
♪ The hazy, distant mountains
are just like you ♪

27:59.000 --> 28:00.480
It's a kind of medicinal ink.

28:00.480 --> 28:01.590
Applying it to the wound

28:01.590 --> 28:03.240
can reduce swelling and stop bleeding.

28:01.840 --> 28:06.320
♪ A winding bridge
reflected in the water pavilion ♪

28:03.750 --> 28:04.880
But the rouge ink

28:04.880 --> 28:06.920
is rare even in Huizhou.

28:07.350 --> 28:10.720
♪ If we are to part ways ♪

28:07.480 --> 28:09.200
When I was little and playful,

28:09.620 --> 28:10.880
every time I went out,

28:10.930 --> 28:18.970
♪ Let the ink speak for me and say,
“Take care” ♪

28:11.110 --> 28:12.590
I would come back with injuries.

28:12.590 --> 28:13.830
My father

28:13.920 --> 28:15.650
specially developed it for me.

28:16.480 --> 28:18.070
But the last piece of rouge ink

28:18.070 --> 28:19.200
was given away.

28:22.110 --> 28:22.920
To whom?

28:23.720 --> 28:24.720
A little boy.

28:25.790 --> 28:27.440
It was on the Mid-Autumn Festival

28:27.440 --> 28:28.960
when I met that little boy.

28:29.640 --> 28:30.790
At that time,

28:31.750 --> 28:33.240
he was being bullied by someone.

28:33.240 --> 28:34.400
I went up to help him.

28:35.240 --> 28:36.480
Then, he followed me

28:36.510 --> 28:37.920
to enjoy Harvest Eve Foraging

28:37.920 --> 28:38.960
and got injured.

28:39.480 --> 28:41.830
Then, I took him back to my house,

28:42.110 --> 28:44.240
used rouge ink to treat his wounds,

28:44.720 --> 28:46.750
and gave it to him.

28:49.000 --> 28:50.400
A little boy

28:51.720 --> 28:52.920
was bullied,

28:53.550 --> 28:54.550
and you saved him?

28:56.080 --> 28:57.030
He's a coward.

28:59.750 --> 29:01.000
But was it proper

29:01.590 --> 29:03.640
to bring a boy

29:03.700 --> 29:04.700
you just met home?

29:04.920 --> 29:06.510
What are you talking about?

29:07.030 --> 29:08.830
He was so little.

29:09.360 --> 29:10.750
He wouldn't hurt me.

29:12.440 --> 29:13.350
Besides,

29:14.920 --> 29:16.070
at that time,

29:16.200 --> 29:18.200
I already considered him my friend.

29:19.400 --> 29:20.070
Friend?

29:22.480 --> 29:23.110
Friend.

29:24.200 --> 29:26.440
You don't know how cute he was.

29:28.300 --> 29:29.860
When I met him,

29:30.310 --> 29:32.590
he was a head shorter than me.

29:33.640 --> 29:35.110
His whole face was round,

29:35.350 --> 29:36.750
and his eyes were round, too.

29:36.750 --> 29:38.800
He also had two small hair buns.

29:39.030 --> 29:40.480
He was incredibly cute.

29:40.590 --> 29:41.790
If you saw him,

29:41.880 --> 29:43.810
you would definitely like him too.

29:44.110 --> 29:44.830
Maybe.

29:46.000 --> 29:49.240
But soon his father took him home.

29:51.110 --> 29:52.110
Later,

29:53.180 --> 29:55.110
something happened to his family,

29:55.780 --> 29:57.430
and I never saw him again.

29:58.400 --> 30:01.160
I wonder where he is

30:01.550 --> 30:02.810
and how he's doing now.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.350
Maybe

30:06.750 --> 30:08.310
he's already gone.

30:14.480 --> 30:16.000
Since he is your friend,

30:16.560 --> 30:18.800
then I wish him well.

30:20.550 --> 30:22.160
But having a friend like you

30:22.810 --> 30:23.740
to remember him,

30:24.750 --> 30:26.010
he'd be very comforted

30:26.450 --> 30:28.970
if he were alive.

30:38.270 --> 30:40.000
We've been walking for a while.

30:40.070 --> 30:41.130
You must be hungry.

30:44.030 --> 30:44.760
Here you are.

30:45.530 --> 30:46.490
Stone Guozi.

30:47.510 --> 30:48.710
Filling our stomachs

30:49.240 --> 30:50.640
will also keep us warm.

30:51.350 --> 30:52.750
You're not from here.

30:52.750 --> 30:54.510
How did you know we locals will

30:54.640 --> 30:57.300
take Stone Guozi
as dry rations when traveling?

30:57.920 --> 31:00.160
I'm just following the local customs.

31:02.480 --> 31:04.830
Actually, my father used
to do business in Huizhou

31:04.830 --> 31:06.490
and loved Huizhou food so much

31:06.590 --> 31:07.750
that our chef at home

31:07.880 --> 31:09.350
was hired from Huizhou.

31:10.000 --> 31:12.480
The chef often made Stone Guozi,

31:12.680 --> 31:14.510
so he also frequently told me

31:14.510 --> 31:16.370
about the customs of Stone Guozi.

31:17.640 --> 31:20.240
You really are a young master
from a wealthy family.

31:20.240 --> 31:22.770
You even specially hired
a chef from Huizhou.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.880
What about the rest of your family?

31:27.880 --> 31:29.880
Are they still in your hometown now?

31:34.350 --> 31:35.750
It's not peaceful there.

31:36.200 --> 31:38.060
Our home was attacked by bandits.

31:38.480 --> 31:39.640
Except for me,

31:40.000 --> 31:41.270
all my family members were

31:41.270 --> 31:42.750
killed by bandits.

31:43.070 --> 31:45.200
I was the only one who luckily escaped.

31:49.550 --> 31:50.480
I'm sorry.

31:51.000 --> 31:52.440
I didn't know your past

31:52.510 --> 31:53.510
was so rough.

31:56.400 --> 31:57.830
That's all in the past.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.920
But

32:03.310 --> 32:05.070
in the past, I really was

32:05.070 --> 32:06.790
a young master of a wealthy family.

32:06.790 --> 32:07.720
But now,

32:08.270 --> 32:10.030
I can only rely on my own

32:10.640 --> 32:12.480
to build a business.

32:12.830 --> 32:14.880
That is a really capable man.

32:19.030 --> 32:20.090
It's getting late.

32:20.200 --> 32:21.310
Let's keep moving.

32:21.610 --> 32:23.340
It's cold in the mountains too.

32:24.070 --> 32:24.680
Okay.

32:25.400 --> 32:25.930
Let's go.

32:26.070 --> 32:26.600
Let's go.

32:32.010 --> 32:32.580
Let's go.

32:59.550 --> 33:00.880
Please come in, you two.

33:11.590 --> 33:12.680
Mr. Dongtu,

33:12.680 --> 33:13.680
I am Li Zhen.

33:13.720 --> 33:15.640
I came here specifically to invite you

33:15.640 --> 33:18.840
to test the new ancient lacquer-soot ink
of the Li family.

33:19.130 --> 33:22.050
[Mr. Dongtu]

33:22.000 --> 33:23.540
Third Master Chen

33:24.350 --> 33:26.310
rarely speaks up so easily.

33:27.160 --> 33:30.030
It seems he really likes you two.

33:30.510 --> 33:33.440
The spring cold in Mount Qiyun
hasn't passed lately.

33:33.790 --> 33:35.400
I just brewed a pot of tea.

33:35.400 --> 33:36.350
Have some

33:36.920 --> 33:38.050
to ward off the cold.

33:41.830 --> 33:43.090
Thank you, Mr. Dongtu.

33:45.900 --> 33:47.820
You came all this way.

33:47.960 --> 33:50.420
The way must have been
hard to travel, right?

33:51.240 --> 33:52.720
Although it was difficult,

33:52.720 --> 33:55.270
there was a sea of clouds
and strange pines along the way

33:55.270 --> 33:56.590
with clear mountains and waters.

33:56.590 --> 33:58.160
It felt like walking into a painting.

33:58.160 --> 34:01.270
Mount Qiyun is indeed a blessed

34:01.270 --> 34:02.870
and sacred Taoist mountain.

34:05.480 --> 34:06.310
Master Qi.

34:08.070 --> 34:10.760
I built this studio here.

34:12.020 --> 34:13.489
Do you know why?

34:16.070 --> 34:19.440
Then, I will make a bold guess.

34:19.840 --> 34:21.280
I just observed that

34:21.440 --> 34:22.840
all of your paintings,

34:22.840 --> 34:24.880
whether it's mountain views
or river views,

34:24.880 --> 34:26.190
feature pine trees.

34:26.800 --> 34:29.800
Could it be related
to the pine scenery here?

34:30.800 --> 34:31.600
That's right.

34:32.750 --> 34:34.280
All my life,

34:34.280 --> 34:36.070
I have loved nothing but pine trees.

34:36.070 --> 34:39.110
But nowadays, the pine forests in Huizhou

34:39.110 --> 34:41.190
are getting sparser year by year.

34:41.840 --> 34:43.840
Only by retreating here

34:44.280 --> 34:47.400
can I find this ideal place.

34:50.150 --> 34:51.670
The pine forests are sparse

34:51.670 --> 34:54.730
because of the booming
ink industry in Huizhou, right?

34:56.000 --> 34:57.030
Mr. Dongtu,

34:57.440 --> 34:59.000
my grandfather said

34:59.000 --> 35:01.280
that thousand-year-old pine wood

35:01.400 --> 35:02.710
was everywhere before.

35:02.710 --> 35:06.070
But now, if ink makers want to
find century-old pine wood,

35:06.190 --> 35:08.390
they have to go deep into the mountains.

35:10.150 --> 35:12.030
Green and straight pine trees

35:12.360 --> 35:13.510
were cut down,

35:13.670 --> 35:15.030
made into an inkstick,

35:15.110 --> 35:16.920
and then handed to me

35:17.030 --> 35:19.960
to paint the disappearing pine scenery.

35:20.230 --> 35:22.400
It's really ridiculous

35:23.440 --> 35:24.710
and tragic.

35:26.760 --> 35:29.000
Pine trees are the soul of Huizhou

35:29.400 --> 35:31.230
and the foundation of the ink industry.

35:31.230 --> 35:32.760
If no one plants pine trees,

35:32.800 --> 35:36.400
future generations will have
no pines to use or admire.

35:39.190 --> 35:40.360
Mr. Dongtu,

35:40.510 --> 35:42.960
I promise you, substituting tea for wine,

35:43.360 --> 35:46.090
that I will plant pine trees
every year from now on

35:46.320 --> 35:47.320
for Huizhou,

35:47.400 --> 35:48.590
for the ink industry,

35:48.590 --> 35:49.960
for you, Mr. Dongtu,

35:50.030 --> 35:51.890
and also for future generations.

35:52.440 --> 35:53.360
Then,

35:53.670 --> 35:54.670
count me in.

35:55.440 --> 35:56.840
I will follow Miss Li Zhen

35:56.840 --> 35:58.280
to do something for the ink industry

35:58.280 --> 35:59.670
and pine forests

35:59.840 --> 36:00.880
in Huizhou.

36:01.150 --> 36:01.800
Good.

36:01.880 --> 36:03.630
Since you are so sincere,

36:04.010 --> 36:06.680
when I go down the mountain

36:07.230 --> 36:09.110
depends on you two.

36:34.630 --> 36:35.320
We are back.

36:36.880 --> 36:38.740
Where are you going, Miss Li Zhen?

36:39.400 --> 36:40.190
I...

36:40.710 --> 36:42.190
I'm going home.

36:44.440 --> 36:45.800
I didn't expect you

36:46.320 --> 36:47.760
to be somewhat useful.

36:48.150 --> 36:49.960
Thank you for this time.

36:50.230 --> 36:51.290
I'll go back first.

36:52.590 --> 36:53.150
Okay.

37:04.760 --> 37:05.440
Your bag.

37:10.190 --> 37:10.920
I'm leaving.

37:11.030 --> 37:11.670
Goodbye.

37:35.360 --> 37:36.110
Does it hurt?

37:37.960 --> 37:38.550
No.

37:38.590 --> 37:39.590
Not at all.

37:59.320 --> 38:00.480
At that time,

38:00.590 --> 38:02.590
I already considered him my friend.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.480
Friend?

38:07.000 --> 38:09.760
I wonder where he is

38:10.190 --> 38:11.450
and how he's doing now.

38:13.110 --> 38:14.030
Maybe

38:15.440 --> 38:17.000
he's already gone.

38:25.860 --> 38:27.720
[Li Ink]

38:27.590 --> 38:28.550
In the past days,

38:28.550 --> 38:30.670
everyone was eager to restore
the lacquer-soot ink.

38:30.670 --> 38:33.470
Raw lacquer on the market
was already very scarce,

38:33.840 --> 38:35.670
and the Tian family aggressively bought up

38:35.670 --> 38:37.920
all the available stock
within a hundred miles.

38:37.920 --> 38:38.670
Sixth Master

38:38.670 --> 38:40.280
only has this left.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.900
How much lacquer-soot ink

38:43.190 --> 38:44.850
can this raw lacquer produce?

38:45.190 --> 38:46.650
Even at maximum capacity,

38:46.880 --> 38:48.680
we can only produce ten catties.

38:51.440 --> 38:53.190
That is far from enough.

38:54.760 --> 38:55.400
Listen,

38:56.110 --> 38:58.510
send all our people
out to find raw lacquer.

38:58.590 --> 39:01.360
You can assign the servants at will.

39:01.760 --> 39:03.510
Go north to Xi'an,

39:03.510 --> 39:04.840
and south to Zhangzhou.

39:05.230 --> 39:06.150
Hurry.

39:07.000 --> 39:07.630
Yes.

39:09.780 --> 39:13.720
[Ink Workshop]

39:09.900 --> 39:10.730
Manager Shao,

39:11.000 --> 39:11.840
Manager Shao,

39:14.710 --> 39:15.510
Manager Shao,

39:15.630 --> 39:17.480
Seven or eight carriages are outside,

39:17.480 --> 39:20.000
carrying
five hundred catties of raw lacquer.

39:20.000 --> 39:20.800
Who sent them?

39:21.230 --> 39:22.510
The leader's name is Xiao Qi.

39:22.510 --> 39:23.590
He said

39:23.630 --> 39:25.030
Master Qi from Yihousheng

39:25.030 --> 39:26.890
sent it especially to our family.

39:30.070 --> 39:31.000
Master Qi.

39:31.840 --> 39:34.000
Your raw lacquer

39:34.510 --> 39:36.070
is truly a timely help

39:36.840 --> 39:38.840
for Li Ink.

39:39.420 --> 39:41.610
It solves our urgent need.

39:44.070 --> 39:44.960
I

39:46.360 --> 39:47.890
will use tea instead of wine

39:48.360 --> 39:49.440
to toast you.

40:02.100 --> 40:04.230
Seventh Old Madam, don't be so polite.

40:04.360 --> 40:07.320
Even without my raw lacquer,

40:07.480 --> 40:09.670
I think this small matter wouldn't
stump you,

40:09.670 --> 40:13.000
as you have been powerful
in the ink industry for many years.

40:13.000 --> 40:13.960
It's just that

40:14.030 --> 40:14.840
I

40:15.360 --> 40:17.230
have traveled far and wide for many years,

40:17.230 --> 40:18.800
and have seen more

40:18.800 --> 40:21.080
petty tricks of despicable people
than you,

40:21.080 --> 40:22.840
so I stayed ahead of them

40:22.960 --> 40:24.290
by taking one more step.

40:26.490 --> 40:28.610
You are too modest, Master Qi.

40:30.840 --> 40:33.480
The ink testing event is tomorrow.

40:34.230 --> 40:36.670
Zhen has invited Mr. Dongtu.

40:37.880 --> 40:39.510
Your raw lacquer

40:40.190 --> 40:42.030
is precious

40:43.030 --> 40:44.760
to the Li family.

40:47.110 --> 40:48.000
Master Qi,

40:48.590 --> 40:50.230
the Li family's business

40:51.550 --> 40:53.670
has always valued fairness.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.760
No matter what the price of raw lacquer

40:55.760 --> 40:57.550
in Huizhou is,

40:57.550 --> 40:59.510
I will definitely pay

40:59.510 --> 41:01.000
every penny to you.

41:01.840 --> 41:02.590
Old Madam,

41:03.110 --> 41:04.510
I am a businessman.

41:04.630 --> 41:07.290
So, I don't care about
immediate petty profits.

41:07.710 --> 41:08.760
The reason I came this time

41:08.760 --> 41:10.630
is to establish

41:10.710 --> 41:11.880
a long-term business

41:11.880 --> 41:14.510
with the Li family.

41:16.320 --> 41:19.150
Not only will I give this raw lacquer

41:19.150 --> 41:20.190
to Li Ink for free,

41:20.400 --> 41:22.800
but I will also take out
one thousand taels of silver

41:22.800 --> 41:25.200
to invest in the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

41:27.150 --> 41:28.190
It seems

41:29.030 --> 41:31.110
your intention

41:33.070 --> 41:34.510
to give us the raw lacquer

41:34.590 --> 41:36.840
is not to help us.

41:38.840 --> 41:41.000
Old Madam, you worry too much.

41:41.400 --> 41:42.800
The raw lacquer is

41:43.110 --> 41:45.880
my sincerity in cooperating
with the Li family.

41:47.800 --> 41:51.320
We invited Mr. Dongtu
to the ink testing event,

41:52.400 --> 41:54.190
but those ink merchants and scholars

41:54.190 --> 41:56.390
haven't replied to the invitation yet.

41:56.480 --> 41:59.630
The ancient lacquer-soot ink may
not be a great success.

42:00.920 --> 42:02.670
How could I

42:02.840 --> 42:04.630
let you

42:05.000 --> 42:06.880
bear such a risk?

42:09.000 --> 42:09.840
Old Madam,

42:10.710 --> 42:11.710
business

42:12.320 --> 42:13.710
is bound to have risks.

42:13.920 --> 42:16.780
Thank you for considering
my interests, Old Madam.

42:17.320 --> 42:18.800
But I am a businessman,

42:19.110 --> 42:20.920
so I never fear risks,

42:21.470 --> 42:24.070
and I'm willing
to bear the consequences voluntarily.

42:24.070 --> 42:26.070
The Li family and Li Ink

42:27.030 --> 42:30.070
are my only choice for cooperation.

42:31.670 --> 42:32.590
Thank you,

42:34.280 --> 42:37.280
Master Qi, for your high
regard for Li Ink.

42:39.960 --> 42:40.760
But

42:41.440 --> 42:43.640
investing in ancient lacquer-soot ink

42:45.230 --> 42:47.760
is about passing down
the heritage of Li Ink.

42:48.590 --> 42:51.800
It's not just a simple business deal.

42:55.550 --> 42:56.610
Seventh Old Madam,

42:57.230 --> 42:58.360
I see.

42:58.920 --> 43:00.710
After the ink testing event ends,

43:00.710 --> 43:01.480
I

43:02.150 --> 43:03.710
will visit you again.
